<title>USA: USDA delays release of weekly crop progress report.</title>
<headline>USDA delays release of weekly crop progress report.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday that computer problems had forced it to delay release of its weekly crop progress report by at least one-half hour.</p>
<p>The report normally is released each Monday at 1600 EDT/2000 GMT during the growing season.</p>
